# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/octo-3 window (octo-T8 and its three levers on the fused stack; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/octo-3 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN, ONE TAG AT A TIME (wait for the run to finish; never cancel a running card job).
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the
# order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-octo3-1 is the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head WITH the K64j-OQ graft (the oneq arm needs its binary; every other arm runs that
# binary with the lever off). A commit of a file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. This window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# RBL2 (TIMED, the RB turn ABAB of references/fusion-jobs/RB, folded in on this image; RB.json): the tile-aligned drafter window (QWEN_FAST_TAP_WINDOW_ALIGNED, in both octo
# ship candidates) against the production profile it is a lever of. Eight coding agents of eight turns, every turn a returning session rebound onto its parked engine, then
# the hit-mid-cold arrival. TIMED: the ARC runner sets are at ZERO for this job (ORDER.txt, ARC-ZERO); no build, no CI push, no other job beside it. READ: python3
# scripts/ci/rebind_split.py <container log> per arm (the slow count B >= 400 ms and the per-group medians), the turn latencies p50/p90 PAIRED (RBC1, RBL1) and (RBC2,
# RBL2), the transcripts equal; RB's ORDER.txt has the decision. The TAP lever is also audited inside A1 with the octo levers. Estimate: 55 minutes. Duration (estimate): 55
# minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset prefix
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-octo3-1
C2_PREFIX_PLAN=agent-turns-prefix,levern-hit
C2_PREFIX_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-twa
C2_PREFIX_BASELINE=none
C2_PREFIX_AGENTS=8
C2_BOX_MINUTES=55
